- Exams page: search now matches course ID; fixed course_name bug
  (Course model field is actually 'name'); added ?course_id= server filter
- TeacherController: notify enrolled students in real time when an exam
  is published
- StudentController: notify student when profile photo upload succeeds
- Add missing csrf-token meta tag to support.blade.php
